# Library upstream (Zotero)

Zotero **`my pubs`** is the source of truth. `_bibliography/papers.bib`, `_library/`, and `assets/img/publication_preview/` are derived from export + `processing/`.

**Order:** (1) fix the Zotero parent in `my pubs` via Paperful (`/Users/89298/Documents/paperful`), (2) then pipeline scripts if the behaviour should be permanent, (3) site files only with an immediate push-back to Zotero.

**If you edit** previews, PDFs, or bib fields on the site, **also** update Zotero in the same task (e.g. replace the child titled `thumbnail` with `processing/library/sync_previews_to_zotero.py`). Site-only library fixes that would revert on re-export are not done.
